    {
      "id": "claim_391e847c5e4c486ea025c4705fa9b223",
      "statement": "The tool catalog for `dcode tools list` and the `/tools` command is derived by compiling the agent with an offline placeholder chat model (no credentials or network) and reading the bound tool node, so displayed tool names and descriptions cannot drift from what the model actually sees.",
