    {
      "id": "claim_e5a746661a694a4b9a28f77d2ca5e0ce",
      "statement": "When tools= is a list, FilesystemMiddleware omits disallowed tools entirely (never instantiating their factories) rather than merely hiding their schema, so a tool outside the allowlist never reaches the dispatchable tool node; tools='all' or the unset default enables every name subject to backend capability.",
      "evidence": [
