    {
      "id": "claim_59f46121b55c4eda93c1081586f39aa1",
      "statement": "execute is a backend-gated tool available only when the resolved backend implements SandboxBackendProtocol (a shell); when execution is unsupported the tool is filtered from the request at model-call time and, if reached, returns an execution-not-available error.",
