    {
      "id": "claim_eadb6fe853e1452f9e6b032ff63423d3",
      "statement": "At request time _filter_unsupported_tools_and_apply_prompt (on both sync and async model-call paths) drops capability-gated tools the backend cannot serve, reconciles the grep and execute descriptions to whether execution and search tools are active, and appends the virtual-vs-host path routing prompt when execute is active.",
