    {
      "id": "claim_6fb9c9673d6a4c1f878097ea52673019",
      "statement": "grep searches for a literal (non-regex) pattern, with a total match cap governed by grep_max_count (default 1000, overridable per call via max_count or disabled with None), and its description points at the execute tool with rg for genuine regex only when execute is active.",
