      "id": "claim_ac3f3a37e1fc4c93aeb1337e3a2d8aae",
      "statement": "FilesystemPermission rules are enforced inside the tool implementations (not by removing tools) via _check_fs_permission, which matches operation and path against wcmatch globs and returns allow, deny, or interrupt.",
