      "id": "claim_ce49c8bce2ce4a1183b9e1beecf6d125",
      "statement": "FilesystemPermission path patterns are validated at construction (must start with '/', must not contain '..' or '~'), and permissions are rejected when combined with execution-capable backends unless every rule path is scoped to routes, because tool-level permissions for execute are not implemented.",
